       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. STRINGPOINTERDEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 FIRST-NAME  PIC X(10) VALUE "GRACE".
       01 LAST-NAME   PIC X(10) VALUE "HOPPER".
       01 FULL-NAME   PIC X(30) VALUE SPACES.
       01 PTR         PIC 9(2) VALUE 1.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           STRING FIRST-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACE
                  " " DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  LAST-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACE
               INTO FULL-NAME
               WITH POINTER PTR
               ON OVERFLOW DISPLAY "OVERFLOW"
           END-STRING
           DISPLAY "FULL NAME: " FULL-NAME
           DISPLAY "NEXT POSITION: " PTR
           STRING ", USN" DELIMITED BY SIZE
               INTO FULL-NAME
               WITH POINTER PTR
           END-STRING
           DISPLAY "APPENDED: " FULL-NAME
           STOP RUN.
